e ludique et immersive gr\u00e2ce au serious gaming et \u00e0 la gamification.<\/p><p>Voici ce que vous pouvez attendre de notre espace dynamique et \u00e9quip\u00e9 :<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-28a9272 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"28a9272\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-99c30e9\" data-id=\"99c30e9\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5f8e76 elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"f5f8e76\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/e-square.marche.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/3-450x450.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-5213\" alt=\"\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">serious gaming<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Nous utilisons les jeux vid\u00e9o comme outil d\u2019apprentissage s\u00e9rieux. Que vous soyez un \u00e9tudiant, un professionnel ou simplement un passionn\u00e9, nos sessions de serious gaming vous permettront d\u2019acqu\u00e9rir de nouvelles comp\u00e9tences tout en vous amusant.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c900ba5\" data-id=\"c900ba5\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3cea9f1 elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"3cea9f1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/e-square.marche.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/1-450x450.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-5211\" alt=\"\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">gamification<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Nous int\u00e9grons des \u00e9l\u00e9ments de jeu dans des contextes non ludiques. Nos ateliers, stages et cours sont con\u00e7us pour stimuler votre cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9, renforcer vos comp\u00e9tences et vous motiver \u00e0 atteindre vos objectifs.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-562a217 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"562a217\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f358d21\" data-id=\"f358d21\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1cfa6c6 elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"1cfa6c6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/e-square.marche.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-03-27-at-11.18.16-450x450.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-4895\" alt=\"Minecraft e-sport gaming education \u00e9ducation Minecraft PC Sciences Math\u00e9matique Imaginaire\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">minecraft education<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Explore l'univers de Minecraft pour apprendre les math\u00e9matiques en travaillant sur des projets de construction pour comprendre l'espace, les dimensions et les axes X, Y, Z. Apprends aussi la programmation avec le language blocs via l'agent robot et d\u00e9couvre les sciences \u00e0 travers des exp\u00e9riences interactives. Une fa\u00e7on ludique et cr\u00e9ative d'apprendre tout en jouant ! <br>Tu peux aussi simplement d\u00e9couvrir Minecraft en jouant \u00e0 des petits jeux en communaut\u00e9 avec ton groupe.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-268357b\" data-id=\"268357b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-042377a elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"042377a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/e-square.marche.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-03-27-at-12.12.24webp-450x450.webp\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-4901\" alt=\"\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">programmation<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\"><span style=\", sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 300\">Tu n'as jamais cod\u00e9 ? Pas de souci ! <\/span><br><span style=\", sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 300\">Apprends les bases avec le langage blocs dans Minecraft et Lego Spike,\n<\/span>d\u00e9couverte du langage Lua via roblox \n<span style=\", sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 300\">puis d\u00e9couvre le Python \u00e0 travers les jeux vid\u00e9o.<\/span><br><span style=\", sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-weight: 300\">Une initiation ludique et interactive pour s'amuser tout en programmant !<\/span><\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-83c1167 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"83c1167\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8561e13\" data-id=\"8561e13\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3523000 elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"3523000\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/e-square.marche.be\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/03\/IMG-20250111-WA0007-2-450x450.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-4890\" alt=\"\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">tournoi<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Participez \u00e0 nos tournois   internes et externes.\nInterne : pour des affrontements fun entre amis,coll\u00e8gues, jeunes d'un service sur vos jeux pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9s comme\n Fortnite, Rocket League, Super Smash Bros, etc. \n\nExterne : des tournois qui rassemblent joueurs de Belgique et pays voisins, avec un public, sc\u00e8ne et de belles r\u00e9compenses \u00e0 la cl\u00e9 !<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0ad0249\" data-id=\"0ad0249\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3cb750e elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"3cb750e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><fig